Subject: sunxi: add the MangoPi MQ Pro board configuration

Boot the MQ Pro through SPL, OpenSBI and EFI.
Keep Wi-Fi SDIO enabled in the separate Linux DT.

Enable detailed SPL DRAM startup logs on MQ Pro.
Take the DRAM parameters and the early stack address from
Samuel Holland's MQ Pro defconfig.

Link: https://github.com/smaeul/u-boot/blob/2e89b706f5c956a70c989cd31665f1429e9a0b48/configs/mangopi_mq_pro_defconfig
Signed-off-by: khaliforce <kforce@gmail.com>
